        <h1 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl leading-tight mb-8 text-charcoal">
          Ponchatoula
        </h1>
        <div class="space-y-6 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed text-charcoal/90">
          <p>
            The Cave Tangi was Ponchatoula's. Dallas Wood opened it as a nightclub and restaurant in
            October 1938, out on Highway 51 just north of town, and about ten years later he put up the
            Cave Tangi Drive-In across the road. It showed its last picture in 1957.
          </p>
          <p>
            Hammond folks drove down for it too, and people from both towns still talk about it.
            If you have a story or an old photo, we'd love to hear it:
            <a href="mailto:info@nostalgichammond.com" class="underline">info@nostalgichammond.com</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
